Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《尖峰时刻3》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:17.64,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,健二 不准动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:22.49,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,李 你还在等什么？开枪打我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.53,0:08:29.12,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,这样也许能有点帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:38.01,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,放下枪 不然我开枪了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:12.16,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有好好照顾你的父亲 都是我的错 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:59.93,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,师父 我是李督察 我有苏阳柜头的钥匙 我想打开看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:04.69,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,今天早晨来了很多人 带了枪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.69,0:17:06.89,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,搜查了苏阳的箱子 我不能阻止他们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:07.90,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要赶快去找她
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:08.90,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:13.34,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他们打算用对付她爸爸的办法来对付她呀
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.09,0:40:10.23,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,郴州的事情都忘了？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.26,0:40:11.93,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,对 早就不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.96,0:40:14.69,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,在洛杉矶的时候 你可是放了我一条生路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.73,0:40:19.02,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候你可以杀我的 但是你没有开枪 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.05,0:40:21.66,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你并没忘记过去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.69,0:40:24.60,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,我没杀你是因为我不是杀手
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.91,1:06:24.49,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,他把女的带来了 叫电梯下去接他们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:36.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.83,0:01:38.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么情况？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:40.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁让你开了 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't tell you to go! Goddamn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是他 - 是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was him! - It was you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Oh, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人听指挥了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't nobody listening today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.27,0:01:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士 你刚刚挡住了一辆81奥兹莫比尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies, you just dented a '81 Cutlass Supreme.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.94,0:01:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要看一下你们的驾照和注册证件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to see your license and registration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.74,0:01:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄 你没事吧？还好吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother, you OK? You cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:05.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10分钟 听我的信号开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten minutes. Doors open on my signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.65,0:02:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴你能在这里 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you're here, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.19,0:02:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你在我觉得很放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always feel better with you watching my back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:12.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在尽我的职责 大使先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just doing my job, Mr. Ambassador.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.86,0:02:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天跟紧我 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay close today, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.83,0:02:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在创造历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're making history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.27,0:02:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这简直是扯蛋 你知道我是谁吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is bullshit! Do you know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的家族掌管着罗迪欧大道的半条街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My family owns half of Rodeo Drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.04,0:02:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你知道我是谁吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.64,0:02:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是洛杉矶警局的詹姆斯·卡特警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Detective James Carter, LAPD.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家掌管着科伦尚大道的半条街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My family owns half of Crenshaw Boulevard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.78,0:02:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要一个律师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want a lawyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.78,0:02:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要一个私人健身教练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need a personal trainer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:33.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驾照上说你有180磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This license says 180 pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.68,0:02:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你比这车还沉 姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weigh more than the damn car, girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.12,0:02:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我甲状腺有问题 - 那就不要吃甲状腺了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have a thyroid condition. - Well, stop eating thyroids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 难道这次就不能只给个警告之类的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, can't you just, like give us a warning or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:45.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这要看情况了 你们喜欢中国人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That depends. You girls like Chinese?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.80,0:02:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 今晚聚一聚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, we are on for tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.57,0:02:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找到了两个愿意和亚洲警察在一起的妹子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just picked up two girls who wanna play hide the little Asian policeman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.60,0:02:58.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在不方便说话 我正和韩大使在车上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't talk now. I'm in the car with Ambassador Han.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.31,0:02:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我 这俩女孩可靓了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, these girls are sushi grade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.01,0:03:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 千万不要错过哟 - 我得挂了 不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We gotta hit this! - I have to go. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.34,0:03:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在生我的气 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're still mad at me, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.85,0:03:06.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在为在纽约发生的事生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're mad because of what happened when we was in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想再谈那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to talk about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都过去三年了 忘了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was three years ago. When you gonna let it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘了？伊莎贝拉是我的女朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let it go? Isabella was my girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.25,0:03:13.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 我们是朋友 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, we're friends, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就和我出来一个晚上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just come out with me one night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.49,0:03:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我请你吃木须肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mu shu's on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈让我给您问好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mom says hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中国的三合会目前有50万成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Chinese triads now have half a million members...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.39,0:03:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,散布在100多个国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in over 100 countries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.90,0:03:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们已不再是敲诈当地商人的小混混了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And these are not street kids shaking down local merchants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:03.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是成为了花费500亿美金 建立地下帝国的商人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are businessmen who have built a $50 billion empire...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.94,0:04:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从事敲诈 贩毒 卖淫和奴隶交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of extortion, drugs, sex and slavery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要在它将我们吞没之前 将其斩草除根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must cut off the head of this snake before it swallows us whole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为世界刑事法庭的主席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As chairman of the World Criminal Court...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:19.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经委托我的好朋友韩大使来受理此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have entrusted my good friend Ambassador Han to lead the fight...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与世界上最大的犯罪组织抗衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}against the largest criminal organization in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞纳德主席 女士们先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chairman Reynard, ladies and gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.61,0:04:46.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三合会是一个秘密建立的组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The triad society is built on secrecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.28,0:04:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人知道他们是谁 谁是幕后的主使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody knows who these men are, who controls them, who leads them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,500年来没有人知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody has known for 500 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是今天 我带着一个秘密来到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But today, I stand before you with a secret of my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:05:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天 我将会公布一个令在座每一位震惊的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, I will disclose information that affects everyone in this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经过几年的寻找 我确认已经找到了"煞星"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After years of searching, I believe I've finally located Shy Shen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.97,0:05:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大使先生 "煞星"根本就不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Ambassador, Shy Shen does not exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.77,0:05:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 这个"煞星"是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, who is this Shy Shen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧地说 先生 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all due respect, sir, I le...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:27.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家爬下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.99,0:05:29.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫救护车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call an ambulance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找个医生过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone get a doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.76,0:05:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大使被击中了 大使被击中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ambassador down, Ambassador down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.86,0:05:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在他身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃呃呃 在今晚见你们之前我会保管的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-uh-uh. Keeping these till I see you tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各方注意 世界刑事大厦发生枪击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention all units, shots have been fired at the World Criminal Court building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.37,0:06:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中国大使被击中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Chinese Ambassador has been shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中国大使？让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chinese Ambassador? Move your asses over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让开 - 什么？哦 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move over! - What? Whoa. Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.28,0:07:00.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you doing?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他到底要去哪里？- 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where the hell is he goin'? - Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.73,0:07:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛杉矶警局 都他妈给我闪开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}LAPD! Get the hell outta the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们都疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.40,0:07:18.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我回来我会好好收拾你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm-a give your ass a ticket when I come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, I'm comin'!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.61,0:08:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.71,0:08:07.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好啊 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.45,0:08:41.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们彼此都知道 你是不会那么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we both know that's not gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.39,0:08:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,健二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kenji!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到没？我对你太了解了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see? I know you too well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 唔 - 李 你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ungh. - Lee, you OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.51,0:09:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我差点要了你的小命 你为什么不闪开啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We almost killed your ass. Why you didn't move?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来给你介绍一下今晚的两位女士 玛莎和祖拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like for you to meet our dates for this evenin'. Masha and Zoe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:23.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖子是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fat one's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想让我说多少遍？我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times do you want me to say it? I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.10,0:09:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉差点撞到你 哥们 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I ran you over, man. Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是现在 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not now, Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 就站在那里 什么都不要说 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, hold it right there. Don't say a word, Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.31,0:09:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪尔长官 我与这件事没有任何关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Diel, I had nothing to do with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我所作的只是借了辆车 帮李解围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I did was borrow a car, backed up Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他 老搭档\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him, partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.61,0:09:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要见韩大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to see Ambassador Han.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大使刚做完手术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ambassador is just out of surgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:48.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子弹没有射中心脏 他不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bullet missed his heart. He's gonna be OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 你必须给我复职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, you have to give me back my shield...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我参与这个案子 我只是犯了一个小错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and put me on this case. I made one little mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.55,0:09:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别让我坐冷板凳 - 一个小错误？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take a brother off the bench. - One little mistake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.79,0:09:56.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你铐住了两个女士还抢了她们的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You handcuffed two women and stole their car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:09:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然为什么要买保险？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that why we have insurance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.19,0:09:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都有倒霉的时候 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone has an off day, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:02.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上个月你让六个伊朗人蹲了一个星期的牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last month you put six Iranians in jail for a week!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我都知道那些伊朗人是恐怖分子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I both know them Iranians was terrorists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:07.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是加州大学的科学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were scientists at UCLA!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.40,0:10:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有什么大不了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就因为他们在小鼠身上治愈了癌症…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause they cure cancer in rats...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:11.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不代表他们就不会制造爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that doesn't mean they won't blow shit up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.81,0:10:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我负责来寻找凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me find the person who shot Ambassador Han.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.54,0:10:16.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松 卡特 洛杉矶警局不会插手此事的调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax, Carter. The LAPD won't be leading this investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:18.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护大使是我的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ambassador is my responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么也许你可以告诉我 凶手是怎么逃走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then maybe you could tell me exactly how that shooter got away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都不用说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大使的女儿正在过来的路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ambassador's daughter is coming to see her father right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:29.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确保她别再出什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure nothing happens to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:31.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 长官 我们不会让你丢脸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, Captain, we're gonna make you proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.39,0:10:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再想你妻子离开你的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And try not to think about your wife leaving you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:34.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏阳也来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soo Yung's here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她十岁以后我就没有再见过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't seen her since she was ten years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.27,0:10:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她现在就住在洛杉矶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She lives in Los Angeles now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.37,0:10:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去礼品店给她买一个小泰迪熊吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go to the gift shop and get her a little teddy bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经这么"大"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a bra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.34,0:10:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 李 - 苏阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lee! - Soo Yung.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的很高兴你能在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so glad you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:52.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡特警官 - 苏阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Detective Carter. - Soo Yung.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:55.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好久不见了 - 是啊 苏阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's been so long. - So long, Soo Yung.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:56.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么年轻…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... So young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.85,0:11:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他怎么样了？- 刚做完手术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How is he? - He's out of surgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.42,0:11:02.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说他会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said he'll be OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.99,0:11:06.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏阳 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soo Yung, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.24,0:11:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你们两个能答应我一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you both to promise me something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.81,0:11:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你们找到暗杀我父亲的凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to find the man who did this to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:24.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你们能找到他 因为只要我父亲还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to find him because I don't think he'll stop...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:26.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就不会甘休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until my father is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soo Yung.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你们答应我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to hear you say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.95,0:11:33.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我答应你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.89,0:11:40.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:45.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏阳 你父亲在遇害前 正在法庭上发言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soo Yung, your father was addressing the court before he was shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.10,0:11:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两周前 我父亲寄给我了一个信封\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two weeks ago, my father mailed me an envelope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:50.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说如果有什么不测的话…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said if anything ever happened to him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:52.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就让我把它交给你 - 在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I should give it to you. - Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把它放在我任教的武馆的柜子里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put it in my locker at the kung-fu studio where I teach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:12:01.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地址是唐人街第一街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's at 8347 First Street...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.38,0:12:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,8347号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chinatown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.83,0:12:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家去吧 卡特 这件事与你无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go home, Carter. This has nothing to do with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:18.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才和你一样 也答应过苏阳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made Soo Yung a promise, the same as you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.67,0:12:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是中国的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the business of China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 告诉你 我现在是半个中国人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, for your information, I'm part Chinese now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.90,0:12:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的 李 过去的三年里我诵读了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, Lee. For the last three years I've studied...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.91,0:12:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古代的佛经 现在是武术黑带两段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the ancient teachings of Buddha, earning two black belts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且每天下午都在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in wushu martial arts, spending every afternoon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮克邦迪大街上的香港花园按摩院作按摩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the Hong Kong Garden massage parlor on Pico and Bundy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:33.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是半个中国人 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am half-Chinese, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:36.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你是半个中国人 那我就是半个黑人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're half-Chinese, I'm half-black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你同胞 我就会飞了 明白了吗 史努比？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your brother and I'm fly. You down with that, Snoopy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种想法很愚蠢不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's dope, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 李 你当不了黑人 因为你身高不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Lee, you can't be black. There's a height requirement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.89,0:12:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像坐马特洪雪橇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same as riding the Matterhorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去吧 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go home, Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.23,0:12:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能把你一个人留在这里 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't leave you, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.59,0:12:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能抛下我的兄弟不管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't leave my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 听着 都看我这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, listen up! I need everyone's attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是卡特警官 这位是李督察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Detective Carter, this is Inspector Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:21.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要看一下苏阳的柜子 现在就要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to see Soo Yung's locker right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有师父的允许谁都不能到后边去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's allowed in the back without the master's permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听见我刚才说的了吗 我们要看那个柜子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you didn't hear me. We need to see that locker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.87,0:13:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 等一下 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry. - Wait. Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:32.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 交给我好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.84,0:13:36.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿嘿 孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Heh heh. Kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 武力解决不了任何问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen. Violence will solve nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.15,0:13:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像中国一句古话说的 君子动口不动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, as the Chinese say, all great battles are won without fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.45,0:13:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 明白了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. - OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:44.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.02,0:13:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我们都冷静一下 把这个放下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, let's just calm down and put this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哈 - 哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Haa! - Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God da...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:53.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬酒不吃吃罚酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 我要把你们打得落花流水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hoo! Now I'm about to beat the puberty out of y'all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有种过来 有种过来 来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't gonna see it coming. You ain't gonna see it coming, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇… 唔…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waaa! Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.31,0:14:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点逃命吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running for your lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.31,0:14:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候放尊重点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About time y'all showed some respect around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.64,0:14:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯？- 卡特 等师父来了再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Huh? - Carter, wait for the master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:23.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 对不起哥们 我还以为这里是厕所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heh, I'm sorry, man. I thought this was the bathroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.49,0:14:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.76,0:14:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 我遇到麻烦了 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, I got a big problem, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.86,0:14:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个男孩肯定打激素了 头和贝瑞·邦德的一样大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This boy's on steroids. He got a head like Barry Bonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哦 糟糕 - 别这样 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, no. - Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特 你还好吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carter, are you OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:38.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 李 阻止他 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, Lee, get him, Lee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 咱们赶紧离开这个鬼地方…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, let's get the hell outta...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我的脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah! My bunions!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了兄弟 放我走吧 我爱中国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man, let me go. I love Chinese people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.09,0:15:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我不想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. I don't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:15.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中文"投降"怎么说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you say "surrender" in Chinese?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我要把你切成一个大加州卷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. I'm about to slice you up like a giant California roll!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:28.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这老黑真有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny black man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.79,0:15:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh... Oh! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.03,0:15:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要来真格的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not playing no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.60,0:15:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 放手 - 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lee, let go! - Carter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下 把我们放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down! Put us down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:54.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我下来 我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me down! I'm sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.92,0:15:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 我错了 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aaaaah! - I'm sorry, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.18,0:15:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么成这样子了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did we get in this mess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.57,0:16:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.54,0:16:11.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Salute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么我能帮助的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.10,0:16:19.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要问你几个问题 老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be asking the questions, old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- "你"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - Yu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.31,0:16:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 不是我 是你 - 是的 我是"你"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, not me. You. - Yes, I am Yu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.11,0:16:23.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快回答我的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just answer the damn questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.61,0:16:25.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 我告诉你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - I have told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.35,0:16:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你聋了吗？- 不 "你"瞎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you deaf? - No, Yu is blind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.45,0:16:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不瞎 你才瞎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not blind, you blind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我刚才就这么说的 - 你刚才说了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That is what I just said. - You just said what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.15,0:16:33.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没有说什么 我说"你" - 那就是我要问你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I did not say what, I said Yu. - That's what I'm asking you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.85,0:16:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- "你"在回答你的问题 - 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And Yu is answering. - Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你 - 有什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You! - Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.79,0:16:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你 是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you, him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.89,0:16:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么？- "我"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your name? - Mi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 就是你 - 我是"我"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, you! - I am Mi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.66,0:16:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫"我" 我叫"你"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is Mi, and I am Yu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真想使劲抽你屁股 老头 我快被你整疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm about to whup your old ass, man, because I'm sick of playing games!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.70,0:16:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 我 这里所有人的屁股 还有他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, me, everybody's ass around here! Him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡特 卡特 - 我真想踢他屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carter, Carter. - I'm-a kick his ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.34,0:16:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我快被整疯了 - 卡特 交给我处理吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sick of this. - Carter, let me handle this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.81,0:16:52.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 李 不要 李 不要 - 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lee. No, Lee. No! - Carter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.99,0:17:15.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你喂他吃什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what the hell you feeding him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但是他长得太大只了 - 卡特 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- but he is too damn big! - Carter. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都去哪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is everyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警察都哪去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's all the damn cops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:51.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 李 - 警卫都去哪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lee. - Where's security?{\r}
