Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出… 出了什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}W... What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.40,0:17:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.21,0:18:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 事情不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, this ain't good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.14,0:18:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们来找他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.41,0:18:03.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.46,0:18:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
