Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:27.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许动 不然我把你屁股崩飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move, or I'll blow your ass cheeks off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.13,0:18:28.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back.{\r}
