Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:32.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁派你们来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who sent you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.18,0:18:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!{\r}
