Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, Lee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.58,0:19:18.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 我还以为你在掩护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee! I thought you had my back!{\r}
