Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.25,0:19:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.49,0:19:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.46,0:20:04.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 我一直是你坚强的后盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see? I always got your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:06.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你干吗还给我一把没子弹的枪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the hell you give me an empty gun, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.07,0:20:08.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.07,0:20:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你差点害死我 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You almost got me killed, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 啊 - 你是谁？谁派你来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ah! Ahh! - Who are you? Who sent you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.67,0:20:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁派来的啊？你是谁派来的啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who sent you? Who sent you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.35,0:20:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底在说些什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:21.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他在说法语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he's speaking French.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:23.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法语？什么样的中国人说法语？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}French? What kind of Chinaman speak French?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他别耍花招 说英语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him to stop playing around and talk right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.05,0:20:26.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么告诉他？我又不说法语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I tell him? I don't speak French.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.82,0:20:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说英语 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk right, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.69,0:20:33.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你是亚洲人 别这么丢人现眼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! You're Asian. Stop humiliating yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.90,0:20:37.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我闭嘴 闭嘴 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut the hell up. Shut up. Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要和这个人单独待一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna need a few minutes alone with this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你找一个会讲法语的人过来 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find someone here who speaks French, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说英语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak English!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 这位是楼上的礼拜堂的安格尼斯修女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, this is Sister Agnes from the chapel upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:52.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会说非常流利的法语 并且愿意为你们翻译\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She speaks fluent French and has agreed to interpret for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.81,0:20:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修女 非常感谢你能帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sister, we appreciate you doing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.72,0:20:55.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很乐意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.72,0:20:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安格尼斯修女 请问一下是谁派他来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sister Agnes, please ask who sent him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说你们两个都犯了一个大错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says you're both making a big mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.06,0:21:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迟早有一天会求饶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one day soon you'll beg for mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.13,0:21:10.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He also said...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.23,0:21:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了 修女 我们必须知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Sister, we have to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:15.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,性命攸关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's lives at stake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:18.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 他说了一个N开头的词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he used the N-word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.61,0:21:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？N开头的词？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? The N-word?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.71,0:21:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你告诉这个小杂… - 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You tell this little motherf... - Carter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.81,0:21:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家是修女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a nun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.95,0:21:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修女 请告诉这个S开头的 我用F开头的词回敬他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sister, you tell this piece of S-word that I will personally F-word him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.83,0:21:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是不是说"黑鬼"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he say "Negro"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.93,0:21:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他又用了N开头的单词 并且这一次还"问候"了你的祖母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He used the N-word again, but this time he mentioned your grandmother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你告诉他那他妈妈就是一个H\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell him that his mama's a H!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特 我相信"妓女"这个词是W开头的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carter, I believe "whore" is spelled with a W.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 W 他的妹妹也是个W\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. W. And his sister's a W.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.37,0:21:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的祖母是两个W…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his grandmama's a two-bit W...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.34,0:21:57.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她没有牙齿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who makes double because she got no teeth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:59.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你告诉他我是这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell him I said that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.49,0:22:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他又说那个了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he say it again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.49,0:22:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 这一次他用一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. This time he called...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.53,0:22:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意为"小猫"的单词称呼这位先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this gentleman a word that means "cat"...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.23,0:22:19.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用一个音似"蛆"的单词称呼另一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and another word that rhymes with "maggot."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.00,0:22:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.97,0:22:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你告诉他他是一个A.W.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you tell him he's an A.W.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.07,0:22:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 李 "孔"是以H开头的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Lee, "hole" is spelled with a H.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.64,0:22:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我楼上就有字典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a dictionary upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.34,0:22:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就告诉他他没屁眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just call him an asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.65,0:22:38.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说你们两个死定了 就像韩和他的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says you've both been marked for death, like Han and the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.69,0:22:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修女 请转过身去 你不会想看接下来这一幕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh. Sister, turn your back. You don't want to see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.52,0:22:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁是"煞星"？怎样才能找到他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is Shy Shen and how do we find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.59,0:22:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就告诉我们 不然我就把你的蛋蛋割下来塞到你的嘴里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us right now or I'll cut your B's off and shove them in your mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.09,0:22:48.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他的蛋蛋？- 他的蛋蛋 修女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- His beads? - His beads, Sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.40,0:22:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的毛茸茸的 发臭的蛋蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His hairy, stinking beads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me something now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.43,0:22:53.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 把枪给我 把枪给我 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, give me the gun. Give me the gun, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.80,0:22:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都结束了 兄弟 一切都结束了 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over, brother. It's over. OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.77,0:23:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"煞星"是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is Shy Shen?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.41,0:23:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说了什么 修女？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he say, Sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.44,0:23:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说"开枪吧"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said "shoot me."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.68,0:23:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 里面没有子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, there's no bullets in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.51,0:23:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 我正要杀人呢 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry. - I am trying to kill somebody, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.15,0:23:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn. OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.89,0:23:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好现在就告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better tell me something right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.15,0:23:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这就把你送上西天 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll send you right to heaven, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.32,0:23:16.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不管了 - 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't even care no more. - Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.76,0:23:19.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我既然死定了 就没什么可失去的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm marked for death. I ain't got nothing to lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.96,0:23:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样 修女 向上帝祷告 告诉他他很快就会有伴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, Sister. Call the Lord and tell him he about to have some company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carter, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.93,0:23:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.93,0:23:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡特 够了 - 哦 她快祈祷完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carter, enough. - Oh, she's almost done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.97,0:23:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我主 原谅我的罪过吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me, Father, for I have sinned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.44,0:23:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.78,0:23:38.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他说了什么？- 罗斯福·德·弗兰克林大街50号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did he say? - 50 Franklin D. Roosevelt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.75,0:23:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉纳维芙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genevieve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.95,0:23:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.12,0:23:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常高兴与你合作 修女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice working with ya, Sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.45,0:23:47.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随时奉陪 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anytime, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.29,0:23:50.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗斯福·德·弗兰克林大街50号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}50 FDR.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.76,0:23:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是个地址 - 简直就是大海捞针\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's an address. - It's a wild goose chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.73,0:23:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国的所有城市都有以罗斯福命名的街道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every city in America has a street named after Roosevelt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.26,0:23:57.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 吉纳维芙又是谁？- 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And who is Genevieve? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.46,0:24:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏阳 我们要带你离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soo Yung, we're getting you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.17,0:24:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 这里对你来说不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - It's not safe for you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.84,0:24:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会离开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't leave him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.10,0:24:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.03,0:24:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 苏阳 - 瑞纳德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Soo Yung. - Mr. Reynard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.20,0:24:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴你父亲没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad your father is OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.84,0:24:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的人会寸步不离的保护他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My people won't leave his side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.60,0:24:38.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我向你保证 - 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have my word. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.34,0:24:39.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.67,0:24:41.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 我这是要去哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ah. - Wh... Where am I going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.98,0:24:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要离开洛杉矶 这里对我们来说不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting out of Los Angeles. It's not safe for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.38,0:24:47.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就几天 苏阳 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a few days, Soo Yung. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.55,0:24:50.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你将跟着我和我的家人去巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll come with me and my family to Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.39,0:24:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.73,0:25:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.70,0:25:04.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们答应过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made me a promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.23,0:25:07.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.85,0:25:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.58,0:25:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们抓到了个只会讲法语的刺客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a assassin in custody who only speaks French...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.38,0:25:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一辆豪华轿车在法国领事馆前爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a limo blows up at the French Consulate...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.02,0:25:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一次世界刑庭会议 将于两天后在巴黎召开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the next meeting of the World Court is in Paris, two days from now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.99,0:25:32.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你想的和我想的一样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you thinking what I'm thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.26,0:25:33.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.33,0:25:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该去斐济岛躲上一年…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That we go to Fiji, we hide out for a year...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.13,0:25:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隐姓埋名 做个吧台服务生之类的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe change our names, get jobs as bartenders...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.00,0:25:38.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我叫你木子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm-a call you Kiko.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.37,0:25:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须在"煞星"找到我们之前找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to find Shy Shen before he finds us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.23,0:25:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也要去巴黎 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to Paris, aren't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.70,0:25:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 就在今晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.25,0:25:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道法国女人平均34%的时间是裸体吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know the average French woman is naked 34 percent of the time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.18,0:25:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是去见女人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not going there to meet women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.32,0:26:05.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须忘掉她 我会再给你找一个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to forget about her, and let me hook you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.13,0:26:08.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对伊莎贝拉那样 还想再给我找一个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hook me up? After what you did to Isabella?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.06,0:26:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那纯属于意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.76,0:26:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说你又没有和她睡过觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, you never even slept with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.20,0:26:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏了你 原本有希望的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to you. It was going to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.77,0:26:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你却给搅了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you just had to ruin it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.20,0:26:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了什么以至于这么严重？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did I do that was so terrible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.47,0:26:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你开枪击中了我的女朋友 射伤了她的脖子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shot my girlfriend. In the neck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.07,0:26:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没什么好说的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing else to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.44,0:26:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她又没有死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like she died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.64,0:26:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的眼神还是那么无精打采 她仍在墨西哥餐厅工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So she has droopy eyes. So she works at El Poco Loco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.71,0:26:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是暂时的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was temporary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.21,0:26:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要她能眨眼 特勤局就会立刻把她调回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as she could blink, the Secret Service took her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.78,0:26:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你的问题出在哪吗？你需要休息 需要好好玩玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what your problem is? You need to relax, have some fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.85,0:26:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你米饭吃的太多了 都开始便秘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have too much rice in your diet. You're constipated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.55,0:26:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就不该带你来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never should have brought you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.12,0:26:37.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面对现实吧 你需要我 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Face it, you need me, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.56,0:26:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要任何人 你也不要叫我兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need anyone. And please don't call me brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.03,0:26:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.06,0:26:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴黎地下男士俱乐部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Underground gentleman's club in Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.30,0:26:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉帕斯俱乐部？得了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Club La Passe"? Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.13,0:26:48.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,检查一下地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check out the address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.34,0:26:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"罗斯福·德·弗兰克林大街50号"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"50 Franklin D... Roosevelt."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.77,0:26:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如我说的 你需要我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, you need me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.11,0:26:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐 请给我们一份鱼丸冻 和一些泻药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Scuse me. Can we have one gefilte fish and some Ex-Lax?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.45,0:27:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的行李箱跑哪去了 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the bags at, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.25,0:27:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰了 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.86,0:27:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是反间谍局的特派员莱维 两位能否跟我走一趟呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commissaire Revi of the DST. Would you please come with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.93,0:27:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.26,0:27:17.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是需要问你们几个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just need to ask you a few questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.03,0:27:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 哦 哥们 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Oh! Man! Goddamn, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.60,0:27:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 哥们 这是我见过的最烂的机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Man, this is by far the worst airport I ever been to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.51,0:27:27.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.17,0:27:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喔 - 啊 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ooph! - Ah, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.78,0:27:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了听着 现在你们哪位可以告诉我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that I have your attention, why don't you tell me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.18,0:27:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些警察来巴黎找什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what you cops are looking for here in Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.35,0:27:35.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你说过了 我们是来度假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, man. We on vacation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.72,0:27:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是来看看风景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just taking in the sights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.22,0:27:39.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生们 这是我的城市…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, this is my city...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.69,0:27:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果两个破警察来这里 脑袋被三合会爆开花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm responsible if two stupid cops come here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.49,0:27:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是要负责任的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get their heads blown off by the triads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.19,0:27:49.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我虽然没法逼你们回去 但是却可以给你们些忠告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I can't force you to leave, but I can make the suggestion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.36,0:27:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 我在你的夹克衫里 发现了这把肮脏的小手枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, I found this dirty little gun inside your jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.13,0:27:58.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这意味着你们两个可以在我这里 蹲上20年的牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means you could both do 20 years in my jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.14,0:27:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们彼此了解了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we understand each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.91,0:28:02.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们彼此了解了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we understand each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.91,0:28:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 很高兴与你们两个见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent. It was wonderful meeting you both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.92,0:28:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我们现在可以走了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we can go now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.82,0:28:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个花不了多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will just take a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.72,0:28:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.52,0:28:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.60,0:28:30.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 你们要去哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ahh. - Where you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.94,0:28:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 罗斯福 呃…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ugh. - 50 Franklin, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.94,0:28:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德·弗兰克林大街50号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}D. Roosevelt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.04,0:28:35.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.94,0:28:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我不载他这种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I don't drive his kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.61,0:28:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我这种？- 美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My kind? - Americans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.18,0:28:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不载美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't drive Americans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.58,0:28:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但我是中国人 - 是的 但你们两个是一起的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I'm Chinese. - Yeah, but you're with him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.62,0:28:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是世上最暴力的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they're the most violent people on earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.45,0:28:46.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们总是引起战争 总是滥杀无辜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always starting wars, always killing people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.82,0:28:48.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国人让我感到恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Americans make me sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.52,0:28:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听者 伙计 我们现在没心情说这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, man, we are not in the mood for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.59,0:28:53.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和我的搭档 刚刚被一个法国佬侵犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and my partner just got violated by a small Frenchman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.36,0:28:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还带着一个超大的戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wearing a very large ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.96,0:28:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这群可悲的罪犯 总是以武力解决问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a pathetic bunch of criminals who always resort to violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.60,0:29:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是欺负弱者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always push around the little guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.10,0:29:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 那都不是真的 美国人并不暴力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, that stuff ain't true. America's not violent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.94,0:29:03.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了吧 美国就是一个笑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, America is a joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.90,0:29:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们侵略越南失败了 侵略伊拉克也失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost in Vietnam, you lost in Iraq.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.91,0:29:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们甚至连打篮球 也不是欧洲人的对手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't even beat the Europeans in basketball anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.48,0:29:09.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梦幻队已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dream Team is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.98,0:29:12.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 我没听清 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha ha. I didn't hear you, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.38,0:29:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有种你再说说NBA 我赌你不敢 我赌你肯定不敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk about the NBA again, I dare ya. I double-dare ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.81,0:29:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就连你们皮包骨头的女人都让我感到恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even your skinny women disgust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.12,0:29:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哈里·贝瑞 - 哦 我已经受不了了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Halle Berry. - Aw, hell no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.02,0:29:20.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你扯的太远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you done gone too far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.25,0:29:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要暴力是吗 全身恶臭的法国佬？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want violence, smelly Frenchman? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.86,0:29:23.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要暴力？好的 这就让你尝尝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want violence? Well, you got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.62,0:29:25.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡特 把枪放下 - 说你爱美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carter, put the gun down. - Say you love America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.63,0:29:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱美国 求你了 不要杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love America. Please, don't kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.06,0:29:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唱国歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sing the national anthem!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.16,0:29:33.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那个 唱美国国歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that one, man! Sing the American one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.33,0:29:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会唱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.08,0:30:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里等我们 乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for us here, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.16,0:30:38.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔啦啦 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh la la. Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.23,0:30:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特 保持警惕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carter, stay focused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.87,0:30:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是来找吉纳维芙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're looking for Genevieve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.60,0:30:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们分头行动 我负责女的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's split up. I'll take the women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.13,0:31:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特 詹姆斯·卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carter. James Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.00,0:31:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你也许不知道我在说什么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you probably don't understand a word I'm saying...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.64,0:31:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我要告诉你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I gotta tell you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.97,0:31:23.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我一生中见过的最漂亮的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're the most beautiful woman I ever seen in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.41,0:31:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真想把你脱光 然后在你全身涂满奶油…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'd like to strip you down and butter you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.68,0:31:27.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像涂奇迹面包那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like a slice of Wonder Bread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.65,0:31:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你刮腋下 并将你全身倒满蜂蜜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And shave your armpits and pour honey all over your naked body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.45,0:31:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后接下来的两个星期里 我将会像只饥饿的熊一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for the next two weeks pretend I was a hungry bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.62,0:31:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 詹姆斯·卡特 我恰巧会讲六种语言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, James Carter, I happen to speak six languages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.09,0:31:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中就有英语？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them English?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.33,0:31:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是玩还是不玩？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you in or out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.27,0:31:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是玩啰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Money plays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.80,0:31:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 下注最少是1000欧元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, it's a thousand-euro minimum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.80,0:31:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还差多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much I'm short?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.31,0:31:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,930欧元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}930 euros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.31,0:31:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 唔 - 没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heh. - It's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.51,0:31:59.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他玩吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.31,0:32:00.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.41,0:32:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Changez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.75,0:32:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 开牌 - 开牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Changez. - Changez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.75,0:32:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开牌？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Changez?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.80,0:32:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在找吉纳维芙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for Genevieve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.44,0:32:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我可以帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.51,0:32:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我讨厌警察哪一点吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what I hate about cops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.18,0:32:39.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使和女人在一起…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even when they're with a woman...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.92,0:32:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们也忘不了抓人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they can't stop thinking about getting their man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.36,0:32:46.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"煞星"是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is Shy Shen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.16,0:32:47.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 我说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See what I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.53,0:32:53.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到楼上来 警官 我会给你你想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come upstairs, cop. I'll give you what you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.20,0:33:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再给我一张 - 先生 这是巴卡拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hit me. - Monsieur, this is baccarat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.11,0:33:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.38,0:33:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为我不知道什么叫巴卡拉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I don't know baccarack when I play it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.71,0:33:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我还是个孩子的时候 我就和我的朋友…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a kid, me and my friends and I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.55,0:33:08.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经常在魔术师强森剧院外闲逛…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}used to hang out in front of the Magic Johnson Theater...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.28,0:33:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且整夜的玩巴卡拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and play baccarack all night long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.52,0:33:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以发牌啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now hit me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.52,0:33:20.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三个K 看仔细了 我赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three kings. Read them and weep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.73,0:33:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三张K的话就是0点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three kings is a zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.17,0:33:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的手气太遭了 您输了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the worst possible hand. You lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.70,0:33:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.94,0:33:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 夫人的是7点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, madame has a 7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.57,0:33:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他赢了10万欧元 了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wins 100,000 euros. Bravo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.04,0:33:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特先生 您似乎给我带来了好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Carter, it appears you have brought me luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.75,0:33:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望能把这好运带到你的床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to bring you breakfast in bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.19,0:33:47.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失陪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.46,0:33:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好样的 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way to go, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.93,0:34:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天小男孩就要变成大男人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, my boy becomes a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.93,0:34:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要帮助我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you helping me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.77,0:34:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我是在帮我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I'm helping myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.21,0:34:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎样才能找到吉纳维芙？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I find Genevieve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.14,0:34:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你喜欢直入正题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you like to get right to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.54,0:34:12.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道"煞星"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know Shy Shen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.08,0:34:16.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想知道一个秘密吗 警官？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to know a secret, cop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.05,0:34:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 请讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.62,0:34:21.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天将有人葬身于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's gonna die here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.99,0:34:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.00,0:35:11.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 你这只卧虎 别把"龙"藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, crouching tiger, don't hide that dragon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.49,0:35:28.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使劲 李 把她屁股翘起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it, Lee. You tear that ass up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.97,0:35:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个超级大变态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a super freak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.60,0:35:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.00,0:35:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.27,0:35:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快跑 - 哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Run! - Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.25,0:35:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ahh! - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.55,0:35:56.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有男朋友吗？- 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got a boyfriend? - Carter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.68,0:36:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.19,0:36:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快开车 - 开快些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Start the car! - Drive fast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.91,0:36:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特 快看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carter. Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.51,0:36:29.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 乔治？开快些 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, George? We need you to go faster, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.32,0:36:30.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 想都别想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.52,0:36:33.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是想杀我 那就来吧 来杀我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna kill me, then go ahead, kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.82,0:36:35.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 开快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ahh! - Drive faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.49,0:36:40.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了 我害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please! I'm scared!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.33,0:36:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔治 你看美国电影吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, you watch American movies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.96,0:36:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 好的 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - OK, man. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.06,0:36:45.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 你是超级特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, you're a super-spy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.20,0:36:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A super-spy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.83,0:36:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好开这辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now drive this cab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.64,0:36:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 加油 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.54,0:36:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是超级特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a super-spy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.79,0:37:08.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼 乔治 开快些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit, George. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.16,0:37:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 乔治…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aah! - George...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.19,0:37:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔治 听我的命令 就踩刹车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I tell you to, hit the brakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.10,0:37:21.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.64,0:37:27.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 他们有枪 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, they got guns, Lee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.08,0:37:33.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 呃 - 倒车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ungh! - Back up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.79,0:37:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好样的 乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way to go, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.50,0:37:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.32,0:38:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.62,0:38:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 哇 他抓住了我的腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Whoa! He's got my leg!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.52,0:38:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊啊啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaaah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.56,0:38:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee! God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.16,0:38:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊啊啊啊 - 抓紧…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aaaaah! - Hold m...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.90,0:38:25.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.87,0:38:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到你自己的车上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your own damn cab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.88,0:38:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇唔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.32,0:38:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.62,0:38:52.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法国人是中立的 我不参与战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The French are neutral! This is not my fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.53,0:38:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不参与…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.23,0:39:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 李 我还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! Lee, I'm alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.47,0:39:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在恍惚中看到了自己的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My whole life flashed in front of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.44,0:39:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三年后我会娶一个中国女孩子做妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In three years I'll be married to a Chinese woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.20,0:39:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有三个孩子 长得很像你 只不过更黑一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had three kids looked just like you, only a little darker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.04,0:39:08.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡特 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carter. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.04,0:39:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手举起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.91,0:39:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.84,0:39:13.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.66,0:39:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人说当法国建这些下水道的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people say the modern world was invented...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.67,0:39:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现代社会便产生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the French built these sewers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.50,0:39:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每小时有1000万加仑的水流过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10 million gallons pumped through every hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.81,0:39:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个没有人曾经见过的奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A marvel that no one ever sees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.11,0:39:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到巴黎 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Paris, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.28,0:39:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 你认识这家伙？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, you know this clown?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.75,0:39:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说啊 李 告诉他我是谁 别害羞啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, Lee. Tell him who I am. Don't be shy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.65,0:39:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他介绍给你的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Introduce him to your shyong dih.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.72,0:39:55.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟？你兄弟？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shyong dih? Your brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.52,0:39:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不经常提起我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't talk about me much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.16,0:40:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 他一生都想着忘掉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, he's spent his whole life trying to forget me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.26,0:40:02.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果人们知道香港的大侦探李 有一个与法律作对的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How would it look if Hong Kong's great Inspector Lee...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.93,0:40:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家会怎样想呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had a brother on the wrong side of the law?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.60,0:40:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不再是我的兄弟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not my brother anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.64,0:40:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我还你个人情吧 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me repay the favor, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.62,0:40:31.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会杀你 如果你答应今晚就离开巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll allow you to live if you promise to leave Paris tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.42,0:40:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么定了 谢谢你带我们参观下水道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a deal. Thank you for showing us the sewer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.23,0:40:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 他是个无恶不作的大坏蛋 我们还是离开这个鬼地方吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, that's a badass suit. Let's get the hell outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.93,0:40:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那韩和他的女儿呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Han and his daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.57,0:40:41.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个我帮不上什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing I can do for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.44,0:40:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我别无选择 - 那我也别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have no choice. - Then I have no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.24,0:40:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我想他要留下 有谁要把我送到机场？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess he's stayin'. Who wanna take me to the airport?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.44,0:40:52.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们永远是兄弟 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll always be brothers, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.65,0:40:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这辈子是 下辈子还是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this life and the next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.29,0:41:01.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我 健二 谁是"煞星"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, Kenji, who's Shy Shen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.52,0:41:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个值得以死来捍卫的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some secrets are worth dying for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.59,0:41:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 好的 明白了 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. OK. A... All right. OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.30,0:41:12.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 这到底是怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, what the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.47,0:41:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.94,0:41:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 看着点 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, which way, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.15,0:41:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 李 门是锁着的 - 走这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit, Lee, it's locked! - Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.15,0:41:35.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 李 - 我们得跳下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lee! - We have to jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.89,0:41:39.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 呜 - 哦 那是下水道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ooph. - Oh, that's the sewer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.46,0:41:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 我不干 李 - 没有办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hell no, Lee! - No choice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.53,0:41:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我宁可死 - 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd rather die. - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.00,0:41:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.73,0:41:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shi-i-i-i-i-it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.47,0:41:56.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想杀了你 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna kill you, Lee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.00,0:42:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上好 欢迎来到广场酒店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bonjour. Welcome to the Plaza Athenee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.34,0:42:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能为您效劳吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How may I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.47,0:42:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真高兴再次见到你 好久不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great to see you again. It's been too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.64,0:42:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 先生 好久不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, far too long, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.14,0:42:16.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我们要一个大套房 有两张床 两个淋浴室…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I need a big suite, two beds, two showers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.15,0:42:19.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要一个按摩师 几件新衣服 和一套护理用品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a massage therapist, some new clothes and a case of Old Spice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.89,0:42:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你的错 你为什么不告诉我健二的事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all your fault. How come you didn't tell me about Kenji?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.19,0:42:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那与你无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was none of your business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.49,0:42:32.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别忘了 他们想要杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In case you missed it, man, people are trying to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.43,0:42:35.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在弄得浑身都是屎 之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm covered in shit and some French cops whupped my ass...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.30,0:42:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被该死的法国警察用电话号码本打屁股…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with some Yellow Pages, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.67,0:42:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以别给说与我无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So don't tell me it ain't none of my business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.30,0:42:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不在香港你该感到幸运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky we're not in Hong Kong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.84,0:42:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那儿的电话本比这厚两倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phone book is twice as big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.37,0:42:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄 你为什么不告诉我你有个兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you didn't tell me you had a brother, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.84,0:42:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 该死 不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hell, no...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.51,0:42:50.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 女士 - 嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lady. - Oui?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.55,0:42:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这该死的狗刚才尿我身上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This damn dog just pissed on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.22,0:42:54.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.59,0:43:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我怎么想的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.32,0:43:03.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你对健二心怀歉意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you feel sorry for this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.46,0:43:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许在洛杉矶的时候 他不是逃走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Kenji didn't get away in LA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.33,0:43:09.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许是你故意放他走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.53,0:43:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在东京的时候 日本黑社会杀他全家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The yakuza killed his family in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.78,0:43:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他7岁的时候就被送到中国了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was sent to China when he was 7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.07,0:43:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寄放在我长大的那家郴州的孤儿院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was put in Chenzhou, the orphanage where I grew up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.57,0:43:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们相依为命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We kept each other alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.78,0:43:24.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们互相照顾 而且直到现在你还在保护他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You protected each other. And you're still protecting him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.68,0:43:27.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我称他兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call him shyong dih.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.58,0:43:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就像我的兄弟一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was like my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.12,0:43:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来我离开了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I left him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.22,0:43:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因为你被领养了 你别无选择啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You was adopted. What choice did you have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.26,0:43:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来他成了街上的小混混\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ended up on the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.93,0:43:39.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是永远都无法理解的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could never understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.53,0:43:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄 我理解 我也有一个兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand, man. I got a brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.16,0:43:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的弟弟培利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My little brother Perry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.20,0:43:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们过去是最好的朋友 现在我们连话都不说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We used to be best friends. Now we don't even speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.47,0:43:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他觉得我向警察告发了他在车库斗鸡的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He think I tipped off the cops about his chicken fights in his garage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.24,0:43:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你相信吗？就因为我的鸡在半决赛中输了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you believe that? My own brother think I'm a snitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.77,0:43:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的亲弟弟居然认为我是个告密者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just because my chicken lost in the semifinals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.61,0:43:52.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我根本就不在意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't even really care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.61,0:43:53.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡特 - 比赛输了一点不奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carter. - Fight was fixed, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.91,0:43:55.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的鸡和他的根本不是一个档次的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My bird was fighting a chicken that didn't make his weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.91,0:43:56.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是它还是坚持下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he still went the distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.01,0:43:59.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它很勇敢 而且吃起来也很美味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had a lotta heart. And he was delicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.45,0:44:02.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好由我自己来解决这件事情 这是私事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's best if I do this on my own. This fight is personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.95,0:44:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我帮你 老兄 听我说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lemme help you, man. I'm-a tell you right now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.55,0:44:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论健二说什么 都是骗你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whatever Kenji's telling you, it ain't true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.12,0:44:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他不是你的兄弟 - 你也不是我的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He ain't your brother. - And you are not my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.66,0:44:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.80,0:44:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是你的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.95,0:45:13.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我想要些炸鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I would like to order some fried chicken, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.92,0:45:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 还要一些红薯派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and some sweet-potato pie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.33,0:45:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merci.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.36,0:45:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 这是你的汤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy your mu shu, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.83,0:45:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Merci. - Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.21,0:46:06.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 "吉纳维芙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hm. "Genevieve."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.22,0:46:22.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 你好啊 督察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh. - Hello, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.29,0:46:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷纳德部长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minister Reynard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.69,0:46:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要杀我和我的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want to kill me. Me and my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.60,0:46:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在过去两个月里…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dozen agents from the French secret police...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.70,0:46:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经有一批法兰西特勤局的警员被谋杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have already been murdered... only this last month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.77,0:46:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这 在我自己城市里 已经在进行一场和三合会的斗争了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are at war with the triads, right here in my own city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.40,0:46:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煞星是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is Shy Shen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.11,0:46:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 煞星… 煞星不是人名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, Shy Shen... uh... Shy Shen is not a person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.48,0:46:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是个名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.01,0:46:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 名单？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A list? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.28,0:46:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每五年 三合会的老大们就会聚到一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every 5 years, the triad bosses come together...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.28,0:46:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在典礼上 他们选出组织的下一届领导人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for an election, and during that ceremony they choose the men who will lead the triads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.15,0:46:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 龙头老大 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dragon heads. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.42,0:46:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后由选出的13个龙头老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}13 dragon heads who will control...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.73,0:46:59.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控制着世界上最大的犯罪集团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the largest criminal organization in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.50,0:47:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的名字都被记在叫着煞星的名单上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And their 13 names are inscribed on the list known as Shy Shen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.27,0:47:08.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个名单秘密代代相传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A list which has been handed down and kept secret... from generation to generation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.07,0:47:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果一旦名单上的名字被泄露…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the names on that list were ever to get out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.78,0:47:16.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这个组织就不再是个秘密了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well, the secret society wouldn't be so secret anymore...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.05,0:47:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们将被关键监狱 或被枪毙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they would all end up in jail, or dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.08,0:47:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这个名单是在巴黎某个地方吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the list is somewhere in Paris?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.85,0:47:25.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个名为"吉纳维芙"的女孩 曾和韩大使联系过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A young lady named Genevieve made contact with Ambassador Han...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.42,0:47:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她应该知道名单的下落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we believe she knows where it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.29,0:47:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,督察 我需要你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm asking for your help, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.03,0:47:36.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来完成韩大使未完成的事业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish what Ambassador Han started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.23,0:47:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在三合会之前找到那个女孩 并找到"煞星"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the girl before the triads do and you'll get Shy Shen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.64,0:48:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听不懂 你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.21,0:48:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是谁？- 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who am I? - Oui.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.28,0:48:29.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是巴布尔斯 新来的服装设计师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Bubbles. The new costume designer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.15,0:48:31.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁看到吉纳维芙了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has anyone seen Genevieve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.25,0:48:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她有自己化妆室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, she has her own dressing room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.79,0:48:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 巴布尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Bubbles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.73,0:48:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们看起来还好吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, do we look OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.17,0:48:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.44,0:48:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些服装太糟糕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These costumes are terrible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.11,0:48:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 快点 我们有事情要做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies, please, we have work to do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.55,0:49:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 我会给金发美女设计服装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, I will dress the blondes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.40,0:49:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.80,0:49:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浅黑肤色的美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the brunettes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.00,0:49:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And finally...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.44,0:49:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混血儿们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the hybrids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.85,0:50:07.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上天赋予了你们绝对的美貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lord have truly bless you all with tremendous talent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.38,0:50:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.72,0:50:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们其中一些人具有相当的潜力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And some of you have what I like to call... silver-dollar potential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.25,0:50:43.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 你在这干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee! What you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.49,0:50:44.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这又做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.49,0:50:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我来找吉纳维芙的 - 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I found Genevieve. - So did I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.22,0:50:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们要杀她 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're gonna kill her. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.96,0:50:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.70,0:50:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 李 你负责灯光 我负责女孩 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lee, you get the lights, I'll get the girl. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.97,0:52:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的生命受到威胁 - 搞什么鬼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your life is in danger. - What the hell's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.44,0:52:15.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你再往前走一步的话 就再也回不来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You step into that spotlight, it's the last step you ever gonna take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.31,0:52:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面有人要杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna kill you right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.05,0:52:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.22,0:52:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·卡特 洛杉矶警察局的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Carter, LAPD.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.72,0:52:30.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起了 詹姆斯 是我个人秀的时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, James. It's time for my solo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.73,0:52:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在最好和我一起走 美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta come with me now, girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.88,0:53:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.95,0:54:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的脏手拿开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your hands off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.12,0:54:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是韩大使的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are friends of Ambassador Han.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.78,0:54:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请相信我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust us, girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.54,0:54:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计程车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.84,0:54:26.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计程车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.68,0:54:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快上车 - 是乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get in. - It's George!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.08,0:54:29.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.78,0:54:35.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友们 我一整天都在找你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been looking for you all day, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.38,0:54:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.49,0:54:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别妄想了 乔治 我们不会赔偿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it, George. We're not paying for any damages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.65,0:54:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 不 不 我不是要你们赔偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, no. I don't want you to pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.72,0:54:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想为你们全程免费服务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna ask if I could drive you full time no charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.89,0:54:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you want to drive us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.96,0:54:48.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的枪战太刺激了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today was amazing. The guns, the shooting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.40,0:54:50.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我明白了什么是真正的美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I understand what it is to be an American.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.80,0:54:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你们了 让我当你们的司机吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, I'm begging you. Let me be your driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.57,0:54:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我今晚也杀一个尝尝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me kill someone tonight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.27,0:54:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远都当不了美国人的 知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never be an American, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.37,0:55:00.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有必要的话 我一天就只喝这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll drink this shit all day if I have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.61,0:55:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就给我一次机会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give me a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.98,0:55:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 把我们带到广场酒店 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, fine. Get us to the Plaza, fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.98,0:55:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题 老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.15,0:55:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐稳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.73,0:55:19.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你认为她从三合会那偷到了煞星？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you think she stole this Shy Shen list from the triads?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.33,0:55:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一种办法可以知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one way to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.26,0:55:22.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我想的一样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thinking what I'm thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.76,0:55:25.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要和她谈谈 让她放松下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need her to talk. Get her relaxed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.20,0:55:27.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者我们可以开瓶酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe open up some wine from the minibar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.81,0:55:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者我们可以放部A片看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should put on a dirty movie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.24,0:55:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 李 - 一部只要9.95元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lee! - Only 9.95.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.31,0:55:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们找到煞星的好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This our chance to find Shy Shen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.11,0:55:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.78,0:55:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.12,0:55:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我和你一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, let me go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.25,0:55:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些事由我一个人来就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some things a man has to do on his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.66,0:55:56.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.16,0:55:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,健二肯定发现我做的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kenji must have figured out what I've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.33,0:56:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm as good as dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.34,0:56:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你偷了名单 对吗？你想把它卖给韩大使？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stole the list, didn't you? You tried to sell it to Han?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.81,0:56:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这样 我是他们中的一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't get it. I'm one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.61,0:56:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我死了 你也必死无疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I'm dead, you're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.35,0:56:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 我们现在很安全 没人知道我们在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we're safe. No one knows we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.79,0:56:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.13,0:56:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人是安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one is safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.63,0:56:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被盯上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm marked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.07,0:56:32.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.30,0:56:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为什么要相信你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now why should I trust you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.87,0:56:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中国有句话说: 驴唇不对马嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As the Chinese say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.57,0:56:39.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.91,0:56:42.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"驴子的唇安不到马的嘴上"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"A donkey's lips will not fit on a horse's mouth."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.75,0:56:46.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是不知道什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure how that applies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.82,0:56:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在想 你的嘴唇很美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I was just thinking you had nice lips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.19,0:56:55.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.42,0:56:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天救了我的命 谢谢你 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved my life today. Thank you, Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.59,0:57:02.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 算了 叫我詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, please. Call me James.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.36,0:57:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或猛男也行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or Stallion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.77,0:57:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久没人挺身而出救我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's saved me in a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.17,0:57:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该怎么报答你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I repay you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.60,0:57:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有20块钱吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got 20 bucks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.91,0:57:14.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10块也行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about ten?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.64,0:57:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man. Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.65,0:57:18.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯 - 嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- James. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.81,0:57:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我很坏 - 我也很坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm bad. - I'm bad too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.22,0:57:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个坏女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a bad girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.38,0:57:23.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈利路亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hallelujah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.49,0:57:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 就这样 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. That's it, baby. Yeah. Uh-oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.50,0:57:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢…就是这样 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha ha. Oh, yeah. That's it, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.20,0:57:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 尽情咬那只耳朵吧 惩罚它吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Bite that ear. Punish that ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.67,0:57:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做你想做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what you wanna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.07,0:57:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 宝贝…喔 喔 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, baby... Whoa, whoa, whoa, wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.04,0:57:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的咪咪很敏感 你得小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My nipples are sensitive. Be careful down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.54,0:57:44.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没和美国人睡过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been with an American man before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.77,0:57:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither have I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.94,0:57:48.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你在一起我觉得很安全 你想要我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel so safe with you. Do you want me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.51,0:57:51.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 "现在做两次 在浴室做一次" 用法语怎么说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha. How you say "Twice now and once in the shower" in French?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.88,0:57:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这等我 我先去趟浴室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait here. I'm going to the bathroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.35,0:57:56.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我自己更舒服些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make myself more comfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.89,0:57:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要我陪你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need some matches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.35,0:58:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动 我一会就回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move. I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.09,0:58:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 客房服务吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, room service?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.33,0:58:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我送瓶蜂蜜还有几罐红牛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send me up a bottle of honey and some Red Bull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.19,0:58:39.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.69,0:58:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪不得单车手阿姆斯特朗总是要来这参加比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder Lance Armstrong came all the way here to ride a bike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.93,0:58:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merci beaucoup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.47,0:58:50.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 宝贝 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oui, baby, oui!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.21,0:58:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.21,0:58:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会骗我吧 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Voulez... vous coucher avec moi, baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.58,0:59:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Je t'aime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.22,0:59:03.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Voulez-vous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.55,0:59:04.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.99,0:59:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你宝贝 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Je t'aime, baby, je t'aime!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.53,0:59:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze! Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.13,0:59:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 见鬼 活见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! Shit! Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.00,0:59:24.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我中枪了 - 没事的 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm shot. - It's OK, it's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.54,0:59:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是皮外伤 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a flesh wound. It's OK. Gen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.91,0:59:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉纳维芙 吉纳维芙 让我帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genevieve, Genevieve, let me help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.11,0:59:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让我帮你 宝贝 - 哦 真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me help you, baby. - I'm terribly sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.11,0:59:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 你去哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm OK. - Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.34,0:59:31.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Je... Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.25,0:59:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们扯平了了 你是故意的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we even now, huh? Is that it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.62,0:59:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开枪打你的女友 你现在报复我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shoot your girl, you shoot my girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.32,0:59:36.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来救你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was trying to save your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.99,0:59:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就不能再等五分钟吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you couldn't wait five minutes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.19,0:59:40.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们… 我们马上就要做爱了 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We... We was about to make love, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.16,0:59:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却被你搅乱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you ruin it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.16,0:59:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会追着来的 我们得离开这 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will be coming for us. We have to get out of here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.39,0:59:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了吧 我们必须马上离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear that? We have to get out of here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.53,0:59:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 李 去死 - 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Damn, Lee! Damn you. - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.53,0:59:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次我要自己一个房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time I'm getting my own damn room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.60,0:59:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们出去 乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them out, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.07,0:59:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人很危险 他们都流血了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These people are danger, they're bleeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.77,0:59:59.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么可以把他们带回家呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you bring them to our home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.41,1:00:02.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波莱特 有些事你必须知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulette, there is something you should know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.18,1:00:03.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不再是以前的那个我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not what you think I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.48,1:00:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你是同性恋不成？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you telling me you're gay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.69,1:00:15.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是想告诉你 我现在是美国间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying tell you... l'm an American spy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.56,1:00:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 你是间谍？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha. You a spy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.16,1:00:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我是警察雇的秘密间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'm working undercover with the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.26,1:00:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在破一宗大案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're about to crack a big case!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.50,1:00:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了 乔治 闭嘴吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut your mouth, George. Not another word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.30,1:00:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和你父亲一样 只是一个笨蛋司机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a stupid cab driver, like your father was a stupid cab driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.60,1:00:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就凭你能破什么大案？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of case could you crack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.10,1:00:29.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无可奉告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.57,1:00:35.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从现在开始 别再干预我的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From this moment on, don't ever ask me about my business!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.91,1:00:38.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我走 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me, schmuck. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.42,1:00:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须离开这座城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get out of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.99,1:00:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们哪都不去 除非你告诉我们到底是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not going anywhere till you tell us exactly what's going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.26,1:00:51.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是从三合会那偷了那份名单？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you steal that list from the triads?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.86,1:00:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉纳维芙 告诉我们真相 否则我们无法帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genevieve, we cannot help you until you tell us the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.03,1:00:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煞星在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Shy Shen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.03,1:01:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.94,1:01:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天 她是个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy mother of Jesus! She's a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.44,1:01:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我居然和这该死的法兰西男人上了二垒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went to second base with a damn Frenchman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.14,1:01:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直就是《哭泣的游戏》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's The Crying Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.54,1:01:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我成了断背卡特了 噢 我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Brokeback Carter. Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.48,1:01:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是男人 这只是假发而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a man. It's just a wig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.28,1:01:14.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定吗 嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure about that? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.55,1:01:16.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 快点过去检查下她有无凸出物？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, go over there and check the hardware.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.32,1:01:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果她身上有什么不该有的凸出物…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she got anything in her bag bigger than a three-iron...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.62,1:01:19.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就踢爆他的屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we gonna beat his ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.95,1:01:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是女人 詹姆斯 一个需要逃命的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a woman, James. A woman who needs a way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.56,1:01:23.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.89,1:01:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 煞星在你那？- 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have Shy Shen? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.96,1:01:27.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是煞星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Shy Shen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.64,1:01:39.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在古代 每当三合会选出新的领导人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In ancient times, when the triads would select new leaders...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.61,1:01:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就把名字秘密纹在一个女人头上…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they would secretly tattoo the names onto a woman...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.78,1:01:46.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个女人带着名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a woman who could carry the list of Shy Shen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.68,1:01:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走遍中国的35个省\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the 35 provinces of China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.38,1:01:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让三合会的成员都知道新领导是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When her journey ended and the new leaders were informed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.92,1:01:56.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任务完成后 这个女人的头就会被砍下来并被永远埋葬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the woman would be beheaded and buried forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.19,1:01:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有记录 也没有证人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No records, no witnesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.66,1:02:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼传统啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What type of tradition is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.43,1:02:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不知道用传真机吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have these guys ever heard of a damn fax machine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.66,1:02:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,健二让我这么做的 他说这是件光荣的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kenji made me do it, said it was a great honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.57,1:02:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这么做是为了他 为了兄弟之情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to do it for him. For the brotherhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.60,1:02:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你为什么要把名单告诉韩大使？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why did you send the names to Han?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.27,1:02:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我觉得国际刑事法庭可以保护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I thought the World Court could protect me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.87,1:02:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我才明白 没人可以保护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now I see... nobody can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.71,1:02:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 你怎么会这么蠢 女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are messed up in some weird shit, lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.11,1:02:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 不 哥们 你到底是男是女？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean man. Whatever the hell you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.05,1:02:21.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a woman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.48,1:02:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会派军队来杀我的 为了保护他们的组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they will send a army to kill me. To protect their way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.85,1:02:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 我们可对付不了军队 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? We can't fight no army, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.16,1:02:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁来保护我？我是说 我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who gonna protect me? I mean us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.43,1:02:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know a place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.07,1:02:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能在这等你们出来了 很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't be here when you come out. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.50,1:02:47.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我老婆说我当不了间谍 我要回去吃晚饭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wife says I can't be a spy, that I have to be home for dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.54,1:02:50.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上我本来就是个司机 仅此而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is I'm a driver. Nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.88,1:02:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.65,1:02:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我永远都无法知道当美国人的滋味了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will never know what it's like to be an American.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.35,1:02:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不会知道杀人是什么感觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never know what it feels like to kill for no reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.25,1:03:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔治 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, it's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.96,1:03:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.66,1:03:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 祝你们好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Au revoir. And good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.99,1:03:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见 乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Au revoir. - Bye, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.74,1:03:17.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞纳德部长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minister Reynard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.81,1:03:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们找到煞星了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.38,1:03:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煞星名单？真不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Shy Shen list? This is incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.38,1:03:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人说它是个神话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people said it was a myth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.75,1:03:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 它不是神话 我见过 感觉过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Naw, it's no myth. I've seen it. Felt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.58,1:03:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还吻过 但不是法兰西式的吻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kissed it. But I didn't French kiss it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.45,1:03:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道这有多危险吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do understand how dangerous this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.49,1:03:34.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会保护我们的 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna use protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.96,1:03:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以请求警方帮助吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we go to the police?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.79,1:03:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当地大部分警察都被三合会控制了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The triads control too many of them here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.56,1:03:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须想办法让你们离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get you out of the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.90,1:03:44.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 亲爱的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, my dear...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.27,1:03:48.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不可以摘下假发 让我们看看煞星的样子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you mind taking off that wig and showing us Shy Shen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.20,1:03:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从没说过她就是煞星名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We never told him she was the list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.78,1:04:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看 13个具有几百年传统意义的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that. 13 names linked to centuries of tradition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.45,1:04:04.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个秘密组织存在的唯一证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only real proof that their secret world exists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.80,1:04:08.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.80,1:04:15.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉纳维芙 缴了他们的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genevieve, get their guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.17,1:04:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早告诉你他不是好人 我没告诉你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you he was bad. Didn't I tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.18,1:04:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.94,1:04:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正想告诉你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I was thinking it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.11,1:04:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得大使馆前的爆炸有问题吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The explosion at the embassy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.51,1:04:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为国际刑事法庭的主席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As head of the World Criminal Court...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.28,1:04:35.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自然会成为他们的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would make sense for me to be a target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.52,1:04:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那晚你为什么来我的房间？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you come to my room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.09,1:04:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来以为 那晚吉纳维芙死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genevieve was going to be killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.35,1:04:43.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你也死在那场枪火之中 那么这次调查就可以结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having you die in the crossfire would put an end to the investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.73,1:04:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 则是另一种结局了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, it will end another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.03,1:04:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 一切都结束了 瑞纳德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha ha. It's over, Reynard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.23,1:04:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道老年人蹲监狱是什么滋味吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what it's like for old men in prison?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.77,1:04:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们管你叫大伯 让你在图书馆工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They call you "pops." They make you work in the library.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.87,1:04:57.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时你就只能与那些老鼠为伴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your best friend? Gonna be a mouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.04,1:05:02.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会去坐牢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.24,1:05:04.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电话响了 督察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a phone call, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.59,1:05:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟 你好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.82,1:05:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做个交易怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to make a trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.59,1:05:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的朋友在洛杉矶获得一样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some friends of mine came across something in Los Angeles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.53,1:05:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很值钱的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something very valuable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.96,1:05:23.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.63,1:05:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.70,1:05:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we understand each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.41,1:05:31.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.57,1:05:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煞星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shy Shen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.34,1:05:36.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚 你和吉纳维芙单独来见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and Genevieve will meet me alone tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.24,1:05:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果让我看到你的搭档或是其它警察的话 就等着收尸吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I see your partner or any other cops, the girl dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.62,1:05:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪见？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.88,1:05:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱斯旺饭店 午夜12点 别迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jules Verne restaurant, midnight. Don't be late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.56,1:07:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎参加聚会啊 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the party, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.30,1:07:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚就让我们庆祝煞星的归来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight we celebrate the return of Shy Shen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.87,1:07:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我兄弟归来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the return of my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.87,1:07:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏阳在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Soo Yung?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.42,1:07:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这剑和我们一样有着过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This sword has a past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.09,1:07:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有伤痛 有流血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And like ours, it has seen much pain, much blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.66,1:07:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几百年前 三合会的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hundreds of years ago the triads would kill their enemies...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.40,1:07:40.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会在敌人身上砍100刀再杀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with 100 cuts to the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.77,1:07:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们非常小心的避开所有主动脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would be very careful to avoid any major arteries...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.34,1:07:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样可以让敌人尽可能多活一会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that the victim would stay alive for as long as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.31,1:07:52.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚才被砍了第一刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have just experienced your first cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.85,1:07:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果苏阳有什么事的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anything happens to Soo Yung...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.55,1:08:01.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远都不会杀我的 李 这点我们都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could never kill me, Lee. We both know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.22,1:08:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know nothing about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.36,1:08:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你没有妻子 没有孩子 没有家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you have no wife, no children, no family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.06,1:08:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早在郴州我们还是小孩的时候 你就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your life ended when we were kids, back in Chenzhou.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.80,1:08:19.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我一样 一无所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have nothing. Just like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.98,1:08:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't say nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.35,1:08:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还有我这个兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.82,1:08:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同父异母而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His brother from another mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.56,1:08:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏阳在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.03,1:08:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好欣赏吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoying the view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.50,1:08:46.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soo Yung!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.77,1:08:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.77,1:08:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.08,1:08:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.64,1:08:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想死吗 健二？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you wanna die, Kenji?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.25,1:08:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把她放下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.82,1:09:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特 把枪放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carter, drop the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.75,1:09:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把她从绳索上放下来 否则我一枪毙了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her off that damn rope, or I'm shooting you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.22,1:09:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别威胁我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the damn Temptations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.92,1:09:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.92,1:09:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! Lee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.49,1:09:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.89,1:09:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快点照做 - 放她下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do it! - Put her down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.63,1:09:17.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm serious!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.33,1:09:19.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not playing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.77,1:09:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是我的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't my damn brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.34,1:09:23.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,健二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kenji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.50,1:09:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把枪放下 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Drop the gun. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.51,1:09:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把枪放下 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it, Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.64,1:09:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.18,1:09:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.12,1:09:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚我将失去一个兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight I lose a brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.79,1:09:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒他 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him, Lee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.30,1:09:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真想把你屁股踢爆 健二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna get your ass kicked, Kenji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.68,1:10:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, kill him already!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.22,1:10:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 他要是你兄弟 就阉了他让他当你姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, he might be your brother, but turn him into your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.77,1:10:32.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.75,1:10:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.41,1:10:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄 给我过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring your little ass here. Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.88,1:10:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaaargh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.05,1:10:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.77,1:11:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李？李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee? Lee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.54,1:11:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坚持住 我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, I'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.55,1:11:18.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the hell off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.46,1:11:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.44,1:11:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Lee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.00,1:12:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God da...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.13,1:13:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了 健二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough, Kenji!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.92,1:14:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还等什么？动手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you waiting for? Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.64,1:14:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.34,1:14:25.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则我们两个都会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or we're both gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.81,1:14:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我可以救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! I can save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.48,1:14:38.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了 李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.69,1:14:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 健二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Kenji!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.43,1:14:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.96,1:15:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来了 苏阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming, Soo Yung!{\r}
